  "statuteText": "110-B:62 Oversight and Administration. –\n\nThe adjutant general shall establish procedures necessary for the administration of the enlistment and reenlistment incentive program and relative to its execution by the New Hampshire Army and Air national guard recruiting offices in coordination with the department of military affairs and veterans services."
